LID - 10.1183/23120541.00673-2022 [doi]
AB  - The ideal airway stent is still not available. Indications for 3D stents 
      currently are limited to rare cases. Therefore, further research is required to 
      investigate whether personalised airway stents will perform better than 
      conventional stents. https://bit.ly/3GLjPa4.
