TI  - Silicone Y-stent Placement for a Secondary Right Carina.
PG  - 563-565
LID - S1043-0679(17)30162-4 [pii]
LID - 10.1053/j.semtcvs.2017.05.016 [doi]
AB  - Recently, several authors have reported stenting into the right upper lobe 
      bronchus using bifurcated stents, but little has been reported on stenting into 
      the right middle or lower lobe bronchus. We report a case with metastatic uterine 
      leiomyosarcoma, who was successfully treated by rigid bronchoscopic intervention, 
      including silicone Y-stenting on the carina between the right middle lobe 
      bronchus and the lower lobe bronchus.
