TI  - Silicone airway stent for treating benign tracheoesophageal fistula.
PG  - 178-80
AB  - We used a silicone tracheal stent successfully to seal a huge benign 
      tracheoesophageal fistula and restore airway patency after treatment with double 
      metallic stenting of the trachea and esophagus failed. The patient was weaned 
      from the ventilator 16 days after the procedure and after 7 months of ventilatory 
      support.
